## Plan submission

Write one executor-ready Markdown plan grounded in the request and repository.
Keep the actual prose authoritative even when structure is partial. Submission checks only readable, substantive plan text and never prescribe its shape.

Submit the complete plan with {{SUBMIT_MD_ARTIFACT_TOOL_REFERENCE}}
(`artifact_type="plan"`). For a similar revision, use
{{EDIT_MD_ARTIFACT_TOOL_REFERENCE}}. Staging is not submission. You may verify
with {{VERIFY_MD_ARTIFACT_TOOL_REFERENCE}} if exposed.

A valid artifact receipt—or a validated, promoted fallback receipt—is
mandatory. After a receipt (or a promoted fallback receipt) you MUST call
{{DECLARE_COMPLETE_TOOL_REFERENCE}} as the final explicit action. The
receipt must be paired with the `declare_complete` call to close the phase;
stopping after submission without the terminal call is incomplete.
